[h1]Dual Romance / No Tango — 0.1.4 Experimental[/h1]
By Hexiao Zhang.

Preserves both romance flags, bypasses the lodge trap, sequences the two romance ending boards, and adjusts Corvo Bianco introductions and residence for both companions. Triss has her own lounge furniture and guest bed. Version 0.1.4 moves her daytime furniture and matching dialogue placement about 4.1 metres northwest of Yennefer, away from the former flower-bed placement.

Targets the inspected Steam Remastered build 25773555 with Blood and Wine resources. Not supported on 1.32 or 4.04. Does not grant romance choices the player has not earned. Back up saves; already executed quest nodes may not replay. After an update, restart and travel to another map and back to reload the manor.

Experimental: 23 offline checks and 5 configuration audits pass. Full in-game regression, navigation, daily schedules, travel and save/reload remain unverified. Other mods editing the same resources may conflict. Do not install duplicate manual and Workshop copies.

Original tooling/source: Copyright (c) 2026 Hexiao Zhang, BSD-3-Clause. Retain copyright, terms, disclaimer and third-party notices when redistributing. Game assets and trademarks remain with their respective owners. Unofficial modification. No separate room-cinematic prototype is included.
